    pipeline: ["Developer", "GitHub", "Jenkins", "Docker", "Amazon ECR", "Amazon EKS", "AWS Load Balancer Controller", "ALB", "Route 53", "Custom Domain + ACM HTTPS", "Application"],
    concept: "A production EKS environment is not one cluster — it is a delivery system. Code flows through CI (Jenkins), is baked into an immutable Docker image, stored in ECR, deployed to EKS, exposed through the AWS Load Balancer Controller + ALB, named by Route 53, encrypted by ACM, and kept healthy by Prometheus/Grafana/Alertmanager, Fluent Bit/Loki/CloudWatch, and IAM + RBAC + NetworkPolicies.",
